  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249361/description_cec7763e-9b9c-4911-803f-d8d120b212c6.png\">船车</strong></span></span></h1><h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>英文</strong></span></h2><p><strong>这款纹理包将原版船只的纹理替换成了一辆非常酷炫的汽车。</strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">需要Optifine</span></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>&nbsp; 作者 @d_de_diego_d</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249361/description_cec7763e-9b9c-4911-803f-d8d120b212c6.png\"></p><h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>西班牙语</strong></span></h2><p><strong>此纹理包将原版船只的纹理替换成了一辆非常酷炫的汽车。</strong></p><p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>需要Optifine</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>作者 @d_de_diego_d</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1249361/description_cec7763e-9b9c-4911-803f-d8d120b212c6.png\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>❤️ 支持我们 ❤️</strong></h2><p><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/wURmd9P3qq\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/discord.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\" width=\"163\" height=\"56\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/posts/donate-me-126284950?utm_medium=clipboard_copy&amp;utm_source=copyLink&amp;utm_campaign=postshare_creator&amp;utm_content=join_link\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/patreon.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\" width=\"180\" height=\"56\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540texturepacks_mc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1232953/description_24a6377c-de2d-48a